  "details": "I have a Logi c900 series webcam, it works on other applications.\n\nAfter joining VRC+ I tried VRC facial tracking, and the camera wouldn't stay on. I restarted the client a few times and no change.\n\nI adjusted the quality a few times and this provided no change.\n\nI made sure that all programs were closed that could possibly interact with the webcam and that my antivirus wasn't blocking it. I get the error \"Webcam Tracking fails : Webcam Incompatible or In use by another program\"",
